== width 80 ==
● Run <c>go test</> and <b>check</> the <i>output</>, then <s>ignore</> the rest.
  A soft break keeps its line, and a hard break
  ends one too. Nested: <b>bold with </><b><c>code</></><b> and </><b><i>italic</></><b> inside</>.

  Links: the docs <d>(https://example.com/docs)</>, https://example.com/auto, and a
  bare https://github.com/yuin/goldmark.
  Images: a diagram <d>(img/diagram.png)</>. Escapes: *not italic*, & © #.
  Words: snake_case_names and 2 * 3 * 4 stay as they are; a
  very_long_identifier_name_that_will_need_wrapping_somewhere too.
